                "description": "Omnia 198/50 Ball Knob - Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this solid brass, Omnia made, doorknob is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this 2 inch diameter knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it.",
